  "method": "Every tracked text file whole-read; all nine images decoded to PNG previews and individually viewed. AVIF/WebP viewing via Pillow is not upstream decoder execution.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "scope": "architecture",
      "finding": "Own Haskell DCT recipe exists; ForeignHash is separate optional native pHash binding disabled by default. Previous wrapper-only classification was incomplete."
    },
    {
      "scope": "recipe",
      "finding": "7x7 reflected mean filter, bilinear edge resize32, matrix cos(i*(j-1)*pi/32)*sqrt(2/32), top-left8x8 including DC, average middle-pair median, strict below-median MSB folding. This matrix differs from conventional DCT-II half-sample cosine; no compatibility with another pHash recipe inferred."
    },
    {
      "scope": "C export",
      "finding": "hs_phash maps every Left decode result to Word64 zero, indistinguishable from a successful all-zero hash. Header declares uint64_t without including stdint.h; caller must supply type definition. Source findings, no ABI execution."
    },
    {
      "scope": "tests",
      "finding": "Three unconditional and two feature-conditional tests. Positive tc compares Either values, without checking Right; equal Left messages can satisfy equality. Negative test only checks unequal Either results. No median, cancellation, traversal, malformed-file or C-error contract coverage."
    },
    {
      "scope": "CLI",
      "finding": "Groups exact Word64 keys only, despite exported Hamming function; no tolerance option, pixel confirmation or low-information guard. Group membership is hash collision evidence rather than exact identity."
    },
    {
      "scope": "traversal",
      "finding": "Starting directories bypass dirP exclusion; starting files bypass fileP. Recursive directory filter uses literal path equality without canonicalization. doesDirectoryExist follows directory symlinks; no visited-set cycle detection is present. Runtime consequences unexecuted."
    },
    {
      "scope": "decoder",
      "finding": "Extension dispatch for .webp/.avif is case-sensitive; selected uppercase alternatives appear only for some CLI extensions. Animated WebP explicitly skipped in dedicated branch; other animation/frame policy not established."
    },
    {
      "scope": "median",
      "finding": "Empty vector reaches index -1; internal imgHash calls on64 coefficients, so not asserted reachable through standard hash pipeline."
    },
    {
      "scope": "performance",
      "finding": "README contains Criterion timing samples and tracked bench harness, but hardware/toolchain/dependency freeze and current paired replication absent. No local speedup claim."
    },
    {
      "scope": "license",
      "finding": "Root BSD3 copyright Vanessa McHale2019-2021; par-traverse BSD3 2019-2020. Both whole-read. Native backend licensing separate; no code adopted."
    }
  ],
